  "description": "The Threem.FactorialLibrary is a lightweight and efficient library for calculating the factorial of a given number. Factorial calculations are essential in various fields, including mathematics, combinatorics, probability, and data science.\n\n\t\t\tThis package is designed to be fast, simple, and easy to integrate into any C# project, making it ideal for students, professionals, and researchers who need accurate factorial computations.",
